Model: (size_t: x 1U; size_t: x 2U)
Later: (size_t: x 33U)
Last: (size_t: x 9U)
fn: read (Last: value) size_t
return: value\x
fn: check () int
    copy: merge: Model Later
    if: copy\[0]x != 1U || copy\[1]x != 33U || copy\x != 33U
        return: 81
    if: read(copy) != 33U
        return: 82
    @: Last alias copy
    alias\x: 44U
    original: merge: Model
    if: copy\[0]x != 1U || copy\[1]x != 44U || original\[0]x != 1U || original\[1]x != 2U
        return: 83
return: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: check(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
